  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Rules:\n\n1. Blue always has the first move\n\n2. The two ways that you
    can move are Jumping and Simple Movement\n\n   - Simple Movement: You can move
    diagonal to the poition of the player\n\n   - Jumping:  If there is a piece blocking
    your diagonal jump and there is a open tile behind your opponents tile then you
    can jump their tile and capture it\n\n3. If your piece makes it to the otherside
    of the board then you will be able to King the piece\n\n   - Kinging: When a
    piece is Kinged the piece will be able to move in any direction of the board\n\n4.
    To end the game you must capture all of your opponents piece's\n\n5. Most importantly
    play fair and be a good sport"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
